{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>泰國娛樂圈傳出令廣大粉絲心碎的噩耗！曾風靡90年代、以性格外型與自然主持風格擄獲人心的泰英混血男星雷麥克唐納（Ray MacDonald），於曼谷自宅中不幸離世，享年49歲。</p><p>根據外媒《Thai PBS News》、《THE STANDARD》綜合報導，妻子於清晨時分發現他倒臥在一樓客廳沙發上且失去意識，急救人員獲報趕抵現場後確認已無生命跡象。突如其來的噩耗震撼泰國演藝圈，許多圈內好友與忠實觀眾紛紛表達沉痛悼念。</p><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175050809937920958614.jpeg/f2A70H7kidjT4La27NccCG-C8SQRwrdlJeO2fCXjtnw\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><p>更多Ray MacDonald的相片：</p><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175184520155136481302.jpeg/ck07yP3kkkceiGl2SznZModkLpJoDgAAr3HpE69x6RM\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175186701324288653472.jpeg/rQfKc-kk0MiJPcnkXeGmAGwptoBAAfUo-zmsK_s5rCs\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175188710526976307914.jpeg/jpdIPp9VXxefTDHMe5RGDR2goHkRA2I7lxxZQZccWUE\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175190828781568745609.jpeg/p6qibvXq-jaAKZws1Mf21mNsFwLDV0oC2GMQENhjEBA\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175192896704512824605.jpeg/TFgQ_k3d8GsPYj2mojM9oowE4gSfJCjcQwXXN0MF1zc\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175186583752704379402.jpeg/USKeLqcamvFCvMjY2Y4QFnnbG20p-E2SQj9UaEI_VGg\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175188848807936413780.jpeg/56JiKw-z_lJLcvxGsVEte1yAPLH2Bk-JJNL2QSTS9kE\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175190962868224654980.jpeg/ur3wz7wPGGx1HzHEQDcWUUE2ytL8CwzvfWzBF31swRc\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175193055956992623548.jpeg/5-iW9A-UZugoOW18ELoWzVO0WkhR58AMmTEhkJkxIZA\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175195140657152402163.jpeg/cPJzmfqagR52oH_OzsYFwW828RgnjMEJlxq_fZcav30\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175186264985600284560.jpeg/vwc5Rg-U2yAwOooZRzlpZxPDIToCMgE8sgbeRbIG3kU\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175188496486400507946.jpeg/BlsS66zUgRqOIlNv-m6GZTXVCNE21dLCtFUy8LRVMvA\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175190501494784392871.jpeg/31DPCdzcopVH6eln_A_X2Y6i-hy2VCKpoGmDdKBpg3Q\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175192636526592530468.jpeg/lhABDrSCC1P5-TVKw-XtQu9qBCjMNyesz6hi-8-oYvs\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260823/1168175195098714112297368.jpeg/4zWgz42Itp68uMJR4TmL1qEEPJeQq4zTmL6ZGJi-mRg\"/><figcaption>Ray MacDonald（Instagram@raymacdonald）</figcaption></figure><p>而據《Khaosod》報導，當地警方在調閱住宅內部的監視器畫面後，確認雷是在凌晨12點12分左右於沙發上猝然倒下失去知覺，期間並無任何外力介入或爭執跡象，現場亦未發現打鬥痕跡，排除他殺可能。妻子悲痛表示，丈夫生前身體狀況良好、並無已知慢性病史，事發前一晚亦無異樣，未料一覺醒來已與摯愛天人永隔，令人唏噓不已。</p><p>針對外界關心的確切死因，根據報導，其好友李奧（Leo Putt）出面代為公開法醫驗屍結果，證實死因為「3條冠狀動脈嚴重狹窄與阻塞」，最終心肌缺血猝死。</p><p>家屬目前已安排將遺體送往當地寺廟辦理後事，一代巨星告別舞台。</p><figure><img alt=\"【延伸閱讀：女歌手Vanessa Blanca浴室重摔離世　救護車遲遲未到最終傷重不治】Vanessa Blanca浴室意外摔倒，頭部猛烈撞擊地面，造成嚴重腦部創傷及顱內出血。家人緊急送醫搶救，最終仍因傷勢過重離世。（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418663146360832263485.jpeg/wLNDQboiC6uttYp5fgjwbGs0o6EMhsySzLltVcy5bVU\"/><figcaption>【延伸閱讀：女歌手Vanessa Blanca浴室重摔離世　救護車遲遲未到最終傷重不治】Vanessa Blanca浴室意外摔倒，頭部猛烈撞擊地面，造成嚴重腦部創傷及顱內出血。家人緊急送醫搶救，最終仍因傷勢過重離世。（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418875877265408890235.jpeg/58ofvLO1Qvmur5R9FfjruCpI-9eHIXYEcbymo3G8pqM\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418883242856448362740.jpeg/Vxm24zVPYkne0vAvccUSOREkFhPtYk1dTQeLUU0Hi1E\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418875982123008546380.jpeg/UIS1V5jvURA0cI_BoAhdFtYMC2Q5Sr10e922yHvdtsg\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418878410756096574293.jpeg/xDMZY6gL4pb_zNg2xVQ8UcvI-P_mw7iX3lsbNN5bGzQ\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418883251245056501687.jpeg/ngDK4Ah_2msbwJTnFAE0fpZ30lI-SSJBnR88kp0fPJI\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418881112018944046351.jpeg/xKNda98xEcwA07MICzafg6Chfwe1gmPgFAbB_xQGwf8\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418885684072448783094.jpeg/nMb_VcchqRwdEvQ710xt4iI8jpqMC543_XK8x_1yvMc\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418878465282048107852.jpeg/p500g52tJtWWBnwRlrKI6boc3lRTMv-tRSv9okUr_aI\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260821/1167418881036521472310489.jpeg/UyfBdZh4juq3JPuaUZrx-FcwtGjgb6-eRQzr40UM6-M\"/><figcaption>Vanessa Blanca（IG@iamvanessablanca）</figcaption></figure><p>3歲愛女染雙流感「吐了好大一口血」 蘿莉塔嚇瘋崩潰求助</p><p>日本茨城深夜5.9強震！何如芸睡夢中被警報嚇醒　驚喊「我住30樓」</p><p>【本文獲「聯合新聞網」授權轉載。】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-23T05:17:54.400264+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":1632,"images":26,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}